    "description": "DEMO SCENARIO: Proves server reloads assertions.json on every restart. Step 7.1 sends an invalid capabilities request (missing apiVersion) which triggers a validation error. The expected HTTP status code comes directly from error_responses.unprocessable.status_code in assertions.json. Change that one value, restart, re-run — the code changes without touching any Go code.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "step-7.0",
